In EverQuest Legends, several zones have been updated with new gear and new NPCs.  Some zones have also been updated to have placeholders for rare and named mobs removed. There are also completely brand new zones that do not appear in the main EverQuest game. More updates, adjustments, and zones are planned in the future.

All tables are organized chronologically.

